0. -16.7952755905511815 Td
(residents. A partnership with an international distributor would now let performers reach listeners abroad.) Tj
0.9837007874015947 Tw
0. -16.7952755905511815 Td
(The distributor offers translation, promotion and payment for selected recordings. For some musicians,) Tj
0 Tw
0. -16.7952755905511815 Td
