(The offer also has conditions. The distributor wants shorter performances, familiar genre labels and a) Tj
1.8449545729860919 Tw
0. -16.7952755905511815 Td
(program that can be promoted consistently across different markets. These requirements are not an) Tj
2.9506721034870846 Tw
0. -16.7952755905511815 Td
(explicit ban on local traditions. Nevertheless, they may favor pieces that are easier for unfamiliar) Tj
3.4074507874015918 Tw
0. -16.7952755905511815 Td
(listeners to recognize. Musicians whose work depends on long storytelling sequences worry that) Tj
0 Tw
0. -16.7952755905511815 Td
(selection would reward only a narrow part of their heritage.) Tj
