(The youth council sees another possibility. Members already combine influences from different places,) Tj
0.4782005558128903 Tw
0. -16.7952755905511815 Td
(and they object to treating culture as a fixed collection of old practices. They want new collaborations to) Tj
1.0711417322834851 Tw
0. -16.7952755905511815 Td
(count as part of local identity. Some elders agree, while asking who will have the authority to approve) Tj
1.3280314960630151 Tw
0. -16.7952755905511815 Td
(how a performance is described. The disagreement is therefore not simply between young innovators) Tj
0 Tw
0. -16.7952755905511815 Td
